    Keep authorized Executive work available during evidence outages
    
    Board discovery failure never establishes new scope. Readable durable handoffs still proceed, calibration and case report failures remain explicit and cannot authorize consequential orders or clear holds. Dispatch status 10 alone means skip; other advisory gate failures cannot stop unrelated work or commit stale fingerprints. Existing recovery timing and expanded cycle smoke pass.

